        <profile name="Gift of Contagion (Psychic)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="20c4-9b25-4f77-852e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack which targets a unit which is Afflicted, that attack has the [Sustained Hits 1] ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Pestilent Fallout (Psychic)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="4108-2036-c473-aa46">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy ^^**Infantry^^** unit hit by one or more of those attacks made with its Plague Wind. Until the end of your opponent&apos;s next turn, that unit is enfeebled. While a unit is enfeebled, subtract 2&quot; from the Move characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="290-e59f-d3bd-9a68">
          <characteristics>
