        <profile name="Spore-laced Shock Waves" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="51dd-7b91-7f32-bd8f">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, each time you select a target for this model&apos;s Plagueburst mortar, roll one D6 for the target unit and every other enemy unit within 3&quot; of the target unit, adding 1 to that roll if the unit being rolled for is Afflicted. On a 6+, the unit being rolled for is struck by spores; after resolving all of this model&apos;s attacks against the target unit, each unit struck by spores suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
