          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your Movement phase, you can select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Movement phase, that unit is rotted. While a unit is rotted, subtract 1 from the Toughness characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
