  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Nurgle&apos;s Gift (Aura)" hidden="false" id="ea42-7d15-fd81-73d6" publicationId="6bb4-8611-986f-58fa" page="1">
      <description>If your Army Faction is DEATH GUARD, while an enemy unit is within Contagion Range of one or more ^^**Death Guard^^** units from your army, it is Afflicted.

CONTAGION RANGE
1st Battle Round: Contagion Range = 3&quot;
2nd Battle Round: Contagion Range = 6&quot;
3rd Battle Round Onwards: Contagion Range = 9&quot;
Contagion Range cannot be greater than 12&quot; after modifiers.


**AFFLICTED**


During the Declare Battle Formations step, select one of the Plagues below. Until the end of the battle, while an enemy unit is Afflicted, subtract 1 from the Toughness characteristic of models in that unit, and that unit has the effect of your chosen Plague.


**Skullsquirm Blight**
Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.


**Rattlejoint Ague**
Worsen the Save characteristic of models in this unit by 1.


**Scabrous Soulrot**
Worsen the Move, Leadership and Objective Control characteristics of models in this unit by 1 (this rule can only worsen a model&apos;s Objective Control characteristic to a minimum of 1).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
