                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this unit ends a Fall Back move, select one enemy unit that was within Engagement Range of this unit at the start of the phase. Roll three D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
