                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a friendly model with the Deadly Demise ability within 9&quot; of the bearer is destroyed, the bearer can use this Crusade Relic. If it does, add 2 to the roll to determine whether mortal wounds are inflicted by that model&apos;s Deadly Demise ability. You cannot target that model with the Putrid Detonation Stratagem.</characteristic>
